{
  "$comment": "Ghoomo Rajasthan design tokens — the ONE source. `npm run tokens` writes src/design/tokens.css (Tailwind @theme) from this; the admin app (Flutter, Phase 5) reads this file too. Colours are from the logo (PLAN_ghoomo_rajasthan.md); every text pair is checked by `npm run contrast`.",
